UUID: 9a5e1644-5757-3c72-aed1-0985fb2e5c09
Includes the material and energy inputs to the production processes, transports of the material inputs and the available process emissions.
Location: production data for one major producer in Portugal used for Europe
Technology: mix of continuous fabrication and fabrication in moulds and splitting (batch process)
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: literature 
Extrapolations: see geography
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_9a5e1644-5757-3c72-aed1-0985fb2e5c09.xml</text>
